WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,670
Nothing unexpected

2
00:00:00,720 --> 00:00:02,600
We may have to participate in the mecha competition in our sophomore year

3
00:00:02,880 --> 00:00:04,280
There must be no problem with Lai La's strength.

4
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:06,400
Just within half a year

5
00:00:06,400 --> 00:00:08,720
The configuration of earning an A-class mecha is a bit nervous.

6
00:00:08,720 --> 00:00:10,080
Then my bones are also here

7
00:00:10,280 --> 00:00:11,240
Is that okay, sister?

8
00:00:11,560 --> 00:00:13,000
You don't need to help us save money

9
00:00:13,440 --> 00:00:14,400
An A-class mecha

10
00:00:14,400 --> 00:00:15,720
Comparing three A-level skeletons

11
00:00:15,720 --> 00:00:17,040
Before an S-class skeleton

12
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:18,480
You don't have to worry

13
00:00:18,720 --> 00:00:19,640
Especially the preparation

14
00:00:20,120 --> 00:00:21,640
Chief Warcaster's Income

15
00:00:21,640 --> 00:00:23,320
This is the point where I hope you will not be anxious.

16
00:00:23,760 --> 00:00:25,160
Yes, brothers

17
00:00:25,590 --> 00:00:26,870
But think clearly

18
00:00:27,070 --> 00:00:28,910
What my sister is most in need of is money.

19
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:31,430
I I thought about it

20
00:00:31,430 --> 00:00:34,470
Just bring mine and Huang Si'er's, right? Huang Si'er is right.

21
00:00:34,470 --> 00:00:36,110
Then two A-class mechas

22
00:00:36,470 --> 00:00:38,830
I also wrapped the little girl’s mecha inside.

23
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,230
It’s the first time I see you and I want to spend money

24
00:00:40,230 --> 00:00:45,430
Unexpected tasks that can’t be spent on

25
00:00:45,430 --> 00:00:47,590
Go find us and go back to stay and come back again

26
00:00:47,590 --> 00:00:49,980
The rest is only for you, little bear.

27
00:00:49,980 --> 00:00:50,900
Wait until that classmate of yours wakes up

28
00:00:50,900 --> 00:00:52,780
Remember to push your sister to her. Remember

29
00:00:52,780 --> 00:00:54,340
If you have mental problems, don’t force yourself

30
00:00:54,340 --> 00:00:55,580
Do you know Dr. Todd?

31
00:00:55,580 --> 00:00:57,380
I don’t force you to go to the district hospital for examination either.
